  "id": "net.receive-work",
  "source": "docs/engine-guide.md#persistence-replay-and-networking",
  "statement": "Each lockstep session entry point shares at most 1024 receive polls and a 256 KiB payload threshold plus one transport-bounded frame across nested drains. Saturation preserves pending messages and late checkpoint diagnostics; finite closure drains finish before storage release. Native regressions are registered; execution remains pending. Complete LREC1 streams remain version 3; diagnostic suffixes with an elided prefix use version 4.",
